      "status": "not_affected",
      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path",
      "impact_statement": "The gadget chain only runs inside ObjectInputStream.readObject on attacker-controlled bytes. Neither Blaze nor any library on its runtime classpath deserializes Java objects from the network, a database or Kafka. All wire and storage formats are JSON, XML or CBOR. Analysed for Blaze 1.10.0 to 1.13.0, see https://github.com/samply/blaze/issues/4732."
    },
